  moveName: Feint Attack
  description: Dash forward. Hitting resets the other normal move's cooldown and
    marks the origin for 3s. Recast to dash back; using the other normal move relocates
    the mark to its origin. Four successful move hits unlock a targeted leap and
    directional bounce with missing-HP damage. Selecting a target starts a brief stationary
    buildup before the lunge. Aim at a target and choose the bounce
    with movement. Cooldown begins when the chain ends; reduced by 1s at level 11.
